flowchart LR
 P[Product Services] --> API[Notification API]
 API --> DB[(Notification Jobs)]
 API --> O[(Outbox)]
 O --> Q[(Queue)]
 Q --> W[Channel Workers]
 W --> PREF[Preferences]
 W --> RATE[Rate Limiter]
 W --> EXT[Email / SMS / Push]
 EXT --> CB[Delivery Callbacks]
 CB --> DB
 W --> RETRY[Retry Scheduler / DLQ]
 RETRY --> Q
 DB --> OBS[Metrics and Tracing]
